      "solution": "Use a_n=a_1+(n-1)d for n=1,...,5. a: 10,14,18,22,26. b: 29,24,19,14,9. c: 17/10,15/10,13/10,11/10,9/10, or 1.7,1.5,1.3,1.1,0.9. d: a_1=-7/2=-21/6; repeatedly add 5/6 to obtain -21/6,-16/6,-11/6,-6/6,-1/6, equivalently -7/2,-8/3,-11/6,-1,-1/6.",
