      "solution": "d=a_2-a_1 and a_6=a_1+5d=a_2+4d. a: d=100-70=30; a_6=70+150=220. b: d=190-240=-50; a_6=240-250=-10. c: d=-5-(-20)=15; a_6=-20+75=55. d: d=1-1/3=2/3; a_6=1/3+10/3=11/3.",
      "distinction": "A coherent ordered (difference,sixth term) pair must satisfy both the initial data and the five-step index distance."
