      "solution": "a: 23-17=29-23=6; b_2=17-6=11; b_1=17-2*6=5. b: -11.5-(-19)=-4-(-11.5)=7.5; b_2=-19-7.5=-26.5; b_1=-19-15=-34.",
      "distinction": "Backward extension subtracts the common difference and keeps the requested b_1,b_2 order."
