    {
      "source_number": "227",
      "task": "Express the common difference symbolically from each specified pair, including all four index gaps.",
      "solution": "Repeated recurrence gives x_j-x_i=(j-i)d. Therefore a: d=x_11-x_10; b: d=(x_8-x_6)/2; c: d=(x_23-x_20)/3; d: d=(x_16-x_12)/4. These are identities for every arithmetic sequence, including d=0.",
